        {
          "id": 1203884406,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "How about\n\n    char *nul;\n\n    /* Does the option contain a NUL? */\n    nul = memchr(opt, '\\0', optlen);\n    if (nul != NULL) {\n        /* Yes. Cut the string short. */\n        optlen = nul - opt;\n    }\n\nand then do the validation.",
